      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "也许是在经典级\n多次参加重赏比赛并取得成绩\n让她产生了一些自信吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f0a18aaa59c61b8a13bf21c199f6f77bd7acb337763795bce31314096182699",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
