    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:625235f980bedaa48268e71f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "向北部玄驹挑战，这一大方向的\n目标已经达成了共识。或许是因为\n在熟悉的地方，高尚骏逸的表情也很开朗。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f0681c43f4367ed6b8882febca079de053ac2e8c62c8942e2270a1c2b6a0601",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1089/storytimeline_501089317.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:048883f91289ecda9230e29b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……对了。\n本来是为了放松的钓鱼，\n一不小心玩得太投入了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "97e2746fcf1419e716096887cb158f36c13924829b473ba49d1a5c4369586e33",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1089/storytimeline_501089317.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        40,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/40/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67b67daa329f4870523741b8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "今天原本的目的是，决定古马级的\n目标。所以——",
      "source_fingerprint": "a8e33fd335258f8d962cc7c4fc4914b0389b69bc2ec68d390716106c5dbdfd03",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1089/storytimeline_501089317.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        41,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/41/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8669c405b2fd54515413ff84",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "高尚骏逸",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a040d8ec3e02a18482ec0c43d3c1c3d865082cc8d8e9b7ec74362d3a63e7fcd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1089/storytimeline_501089317.json",
