    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3273939d63884e92d10d4525",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是『阪神大赏典』吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b4d887587ea7d5d1cdaa1a879ea62e298d8b0b86af9704b34509fc13a164b795",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1089/storytimeline_501089317.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        42,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/42/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2659609d4d0d524ee402e2c2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我提议的，是过年后3月\n在阪神赛马场举行的GⅡ比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9249782dc1b77b1b6581446e8dbac52cd2c65d02a1cf6385d4775f0a92046d2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1089/storytimeline_501089317.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        43,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/43/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:82e7b80c7f95b4a91c6e1602",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然是3000m的长距离，而且古马级的\n实力派们也会聚集于此，是一场艰难的比赛，\n但以现在的实力完全可以争取胜利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "00a4f21c26a81dd1d57f21704c340764d2aca5190cc5128834f37dbfc562a972",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1089/storytimeline_501089317.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        44,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/44/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e2961cf486f8760349ba4bf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "从那里以『天皇赏（春）』为目标吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "762eaa4668a95b62980de7954fd7ca54014e71f58a35b424990e4ab500d3b1c7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1089/storytimeline_501089317.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        45,
