    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1680c515655b98dca0b5b5a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "之所以考虑这个赛程安排，\n是为了实现『菊花赏』归途中\n听到的高尚骏逸的愿望。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c09a828eb33dae381518291749505e01cb0d639b9506a3298c00534fa10d81be",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
